t turned out, so please give it a watch: A second adventure: Echoes in the AbyssOdin’s Trial finally has company. Echoes in the Abyss is a dark sci-fi investigation on a planet that makes it very clear it doesn’t want you there. Here’s what Max, OMEA","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:03:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691530","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:22:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4275550-1842212951300113","game_id":"steam-4275550","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #2: New Adventure - Echoes in the Abyss","summary":"Hi everyone, We’re back with another adventure overview. This time we are showing you one that sits at the far end of what OMEA covers: Echoes in the Abyss, a dark science fiction thriller written by E. Winters.Odin's Trial is about staying alive in the open. The Last Vigil is about a group of strangers shut in together. This one is an investigation set on a planet called Saaremaa, and it is built for players who like to pull on a thread and keep pulling until something gives.\"Welcome to Saarema","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T13:56:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951300113","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:22:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4275550-1841579228665259","game_id":"steam-4275550","kind":"announcement","title":"New Languages Are Coming to OMEA - We Need Your Ears","summary":"Hello everyone!We are starting to give OMEA voices in languages other than English, and the first of them is ready for a listen. It is a newly trained Spanish (LatAm) voice model, and we would like your take on it before we commit to anything. Spanish is first in the queue, not the last. French and Korean are right behind it, so even if Spanish is not your thing, join the Discord and weigh in when your language comes up :)The files and the full instructions are in the #voice-and-languages channe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-20T11:50:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228665259","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:22:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4275550-1841579228662278","game_id":"steam-4275550","kind":"update","title":"OMEA Demo Update - Long-Term Memory and Collectible Cards","summary":"Hello everyone!Odin's Trial, the free OMEA demo, just got another update. Let’s dive in!Long-Term Memory: A Major UpgradeYou've been telling us when the game forgot things it shouldn't have, and that feedback was crucial. This update ships a significant overhaul to how the game remembers your journey, courtesy of Michał, our backend lead and one of our two main devs, who dug through the code and tracked down a major bug that had been quietly causing memory to slip.NEW: Collectible CardsEvery pic","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-19T11:09:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228662278","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:22:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4275550-1840944183773954","game_id":"steam-4275550","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #1: New Adventure - The Last Vigil","summary":"Hi everyone,First of all, we want to thank all of you for playing the OMEA demo, Odin's Trial. Watching people play it and reading what you thought of it has meant a great deal to us, and it is the reason we keep going. One question comes back more often than any other: what are your plans for the future? So today we want to share one of the adventures you will find in the full version of OMEA: The Last Vigil.It is our take on a classic fantasy adventure, dark fantasy to be exact, with a proper ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T13:08:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183773954","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:22:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4275550-1840310314342077","game_id":"steam-4275550","kind":"update","title":"OMEA Demo Update - Volume Sliders and Controller Fixes","summary":"Hello everyone! Odin's Trial, the free OMEA demo, just got another update. This one focuses on sound and controllers. Here's what changed. SoundMusic and sound effects now have their own volume sliders, and \"Mute all\" moved to the Audio tab to sit next to them. Sound effects also obey the effects slider now; menu clicks and pickups used to ignore it. And settings sliders no longer play at full volume while you drag them. ControllerL3 / R3 now open Info and Story Points on the dice screen too.Rum","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T14:26:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314342077","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:22:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4275550-1839676055882681","game_id":"steam-4275550","kind":"update","title":"OMEA Demo Update - Now Steam Deck and Mac Compatible","summary":"Hi everyone!Odin's Trial, the free OMEA demo, just got a big update. The voice engine is new, the story keeps better track of the world, turns are faster, and the demo now runs on Steam Deck and Mac. Here's what changed.Play it on Steam Deck and MacOMEA now runs on Steam Deck and on macOS. If you play with a controller, a few things got easier:L1 / R1 browse the Adventure Library.L3 / R3 open Info and Story Points.The right stick scrolls through long answers.The cursor now stays inside the Setti","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-29T14:25:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055882681","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:22:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4275550-1838407329265523","game_id":"steam-4275550","kind":"announcement","title":"OMEA Demo Is Out Now - Free on Steam.","summary":"Say Anything. The Story Remembers.Odin's Trial, one complete adventure from the upcoming OMEA narrative gaming platform, is out now as a free demo. You play by saying or typing what your character does, in your own words — and the story responds: fully voiced, scored with live music, and aware of every choice you make.Odin's TrialYou are a Viking, washed up alone on a frozen island. Odin has given you one job: find the Beast and put it down. The island wants you dead first - and so do some of th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-20T13:17:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329265523","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:22:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4275550":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:47:42Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:47:42Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4275550":"2026-10-26T11:47:42Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4275550":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:47:42Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:47:42Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:47:42Z"},"4735490":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:47:42Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:47:42Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:47:42Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_versio